  "description": "Kyu-Ha’s been hopelessly crushing on Woo-Hyun ever since their freshman orientation. But at a drinking party, he hears a devastating rumor: queen bee Hye-Jin got to him first! Heartbroken and drunk out of his mind, Kyu-Ha stumbles home, slips into a lacy maid outfit and racy lingerie, and takes some very questionable photos. He then sends some explicit messages to Woo-Hyun via what he thinks is an anonymous burner account - only to wake up the next morning to see it was his real account after all! But Woo-Hyun doesn’t seem to mind…in fact, he seems more than happy to take Kyu-Ha up on his offer!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
